      "head": "private theorem exists_countable_generators_for_measurableSet\n    {X : Type u} (C : Set (Set X)) (s : Set X)\n    (hs : MeasurableSet[MeasurableSpace.generateFrom C] s) :\n    ∃ D : Set (Set X), D.Countable ∧ D ⊆ C ∧\n      MeasurableSet[MeasurableSpace.generateFrom D] s",
